Message call
Send value and calldata to contracts.
first message call is the begining of transaction.
each subsequent message call is part of the same transaction.
the transaction and any state changes only complete when inital function call finishes execution.

Address on the EVM is 160 bits long or 40 character, hexadecimal string.

Message call breakdown
message call can contain gas, value and calldata.
these message value become available as global in solidity.
  1.msg.sender- who made the last message call.
  2.msg.value-amount in wei sent.
  3.msg.data-calldata.
  4.msg.sig-the function identifier.


